    "https://ncwu.edu/community/careers/": {
      "title": "Careers",
      "description": "Careers | North Carolina Wesleyan University Careers | North Carolina Wesleyan University myNCWU Academic Calendar University Catalog Events Campus Map Student/Staff Email Directory Faculty & Staff Resources Recent News & Articles QUICKLINKS My NCWU Library Athletics The Dunn Center Alumni/Donors Student Achievement About Why NC Wesleyan? Campus Map & Tour Bishop Beliefs We are Battling Bishops Departments Publications Faculty & Staff Directory Contact Us Admissions Apply Visit Tuition Deposit Connect with a Counselor Orientation Financial Aid Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Executive Residency Programs Adult & Online Studies Accelerated Dual Degree Pathways Certificate Programs Partnerships Practical Skills Academy Registrar Library Our Faculty Accreditation & Accountability Adult & Online Adult Undergraduate Programs Adult Studies Tuition Financial Aid Graduate & Professional Programs Graduate Programs Tuition Campus Life Live. Eat. Play. Athletics Spiritual Life Student Engagement WesQuest Program International Student Resources Parent Resources First Year Experience Veteran Benefits Community The Dunn Center | Official Site Cultural Arts Mims and Gravely Art Galleries Work at Wesleyan Shelton Challenge Rock the Mount Community Event NCWU Summer Camps Event Venue Rentals Careers Community » Careers Careers at Wesleyan Current Job Openings Administrative & Staff Jobs Graduate Assistant Jobs Faculty Job Openings Full-Time Faculty Positions Adjunct Faculty Positions Applications Download, complete and submit the fillable PDF applications below. Staff Employment Application Adjunct Faculty Application Working at North Carolina Wesleyan University offers a dynamic and enriching career experience in the heart of Rocky Mount, North Carolina. NCWU is a dynamic, growing, liberal arts institution dedicated to engaging students of any age who want to succeed in life and work, and to develop those intellectual and social skills, and personal qualities of mind and heart. As a faculty or staff member, you become part of a vibrant community dedicated to fostering academic excellence and personal growth in students. With a focus on liberal arts education, NC Wesleyan provides ample opportunities for professional development and collaboration among colleagues. Whether you’re in administration, teaching, or supporting roles, you’ll find a supportive environment that values innovation, diversity, and community engagement. Joining NC Wesleyan means contributing to the university’s mission of empowering students to become ethical, confident, and competent leaders in their chosen fields. View Current Job Openings Our Administration, Staff and Faculty enable students to be responsible, productive, contributing, healthy and fulfilled members of a diverse and free society to their families, workplaces, communities, nation and world. The student body, both on campus and off is highly diverse. Faculty are expected to further student learning through actively engaging them by using innovative instructional strategies, including experiential education, technology and internships. A desire to teach both traditional and working adult students is important. APPLICATIONS Please feel free to download, complete and submit the fillable PDF applications below. Adjunct Faculty Application Staff Employment Application For questions or inquiries regarding careers at North Carolina Wesleyan, please contact: Darrell Whitley Director of Human Resources 252.985.5105 dwhitley@ncwu.edu Employment Policies Title IX Policies & Procedures Equal Employment Opportunity (See Personnel Manual) NC Wesleyan University 3400 N. Wesleyan Blvd. Rocky Mount, NC 27804 252.985.5100 800.488.6292 Contact Us Campus Map All Social Media Channels > Resources My NCWU University Catalog Request More Info Events News Student Email Policies & Notices Title IX and Equal Opportunity Campus Hazing Policy Faculty & Staff Resources Media & Branding Resources